  "description": "The affordable Fuji Discovery\n\nseries bikes are fully active, dual-suspension mountain bikes, meaning the\n\nrear suspension works all the time, whether you're standing or sitting, braking,\n\nwhatever.\n\nDiscovery III's frame and pivoting section are both aluminum alloy, strong\n\nand light. The III's fork is a Suntour M7700, 63mm travel. It's rear shock,\n\na Tough Shock MA. Shimano and Suntour components do the shifting, 24 gears\n\ncontrolled by Shimano EZ-Fire Plus handlebar shifters. The hubs are Fuji and\n\nShimano, the spokes stainless, the rims Alex Aluminum.\n\nDiscovery III is the leader of the three-bike series. Try one at your Fuji\n\ndealer.",
